# 自由边界的55粒子LJ团簇；比较有限时间内的成对距离涨落。
variable state index cold warm
variable target index 0.05 0.30
label states
units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary f f f
read_data cluster.data
mass 1 1
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff * * 1 1
pair_modify shift yes
neighbor 0.3 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
minimize 1e-8 1e-8 1000 10000
reset_timestep 0
timestep 0.002
velocity all create ${target} 34567 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix integrate all nve
fix bath all langevin ${target} ${target} 0.2 89123 zero yes
thermo 1000
run 5000
reset_timestep 0
dump coordinates all custom 20 cluster.${state}.dump id type xu yu zu
dump_modify coordinates sort id format float %.12g
run 5000
clear
next state target
jump SELF states
